","name":"populated_text","type":"STRING","links":[41]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-impact-pack","ver":"8.28.3","Node name for S&R":"ImpactWildcardEncode"},"widgets_values":["Without Wildcard:\nThis is an image of a WOMAN, a beautiful detailed photograph, wearing casual clothes, standing in an empty cafe, looking at the viewer, smiling, showing her teeth.\n\nWith Wildcard:\nThis is an image of a WOMAN, __styles/professional__, wearing casual clothes, standing in a __background/interior_modern__, looking at the viewer, smiling, showing her teeth. __lighting/indoor_morning__.","","populate","Select the LoRA to add to the text","Select Wildcard 🟢 Full Cache",0,"randomize"]},{"id":33,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[500,530],"size":[270,570],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note","properties":{},"widgets_values":["### Important\nThe Style & Prompt Encoder (\"Positive\" node) already contains advanced built-in prompt presets. If you choose to use one of these presets, leave the Wildcard field empty. Likewise, when using Wildcards, keep the style to \"none\".\n\n### ImpactWildcardEncode\nWildcard is a reusable text placeholder that randomly inserts one entry from a predefined list, adding variety and reducing prompt repetition.\n\nTo use a Wildcard, create a .txt file inside the wildcards folder of the Impact Pack (custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/wildcards). Each line in the file represents a different prompt entry.\n\nWrite your prompt in the first text box and insert Wildcards wherever desired. Each Wildcard will be replaced with a randomly selected entry from its corresponding .txt file.\n\nLeave the Wildcard field empty and write the prompt normally if you don't want to use Wildcards.\n\n### Tips\n\nTo generate different Wildcard combinations, keep Batch Size = 1 and increase the Batch Count/Queue Count instead. Each new execution re-rolls the Wildcards, while Batch Size usually reuses the same resolved prompt for every image in the batch.\n\nSome prepositions to use along with Wildcards.\n* For lightning: The lightning is a (wildcard)\n* For photo style: The photograph is taken with a (wildcard)\n* For background: Standing/Sitting/Doing/etc something in a (wildcard)"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":23,"type":"Note","pos":[200,530],"size":[270,240],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Models in this Workflow","properties":{},"widgets_values":["flux1-dev-Q8_0:\nhttps://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf/tree/main\n\nclip_l:\nhttps://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/tree/main\n\nt5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q5_K_M:\nhttps://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/tree/main\n\nae:\nhttps://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev/tree/main/vae"],"color":"#2a363b","bgcolor":"#3f5159"}],"links":[[4,4,0,2,0,"MODEL"],[6,20,0,2,3,"FLOAT"],[12,10,0,12,1,"VAE"],[13,12,0,14,0,"IMAGE"],[14,13,0,14,1,"INT"],[15,22,0,14,2,"*"],[16,11,0,14,3,"STRING"],[17,14,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[25,20,0,21,0,"FLOAT"],[26,21,0,22,0,"FLOAT"],[27,24,0,25,2,"CONDITIONING"],[32,25,0,12,0,"LATENT"],[35,27,0,25,0,"LATENT"],[37,28,0,29,0,"MODEL"],[38,29,0,25,1,"MODEL"],[39,30,0,2,1,"CLIP"],[40,31,1,24,0,"CLIP"],[41,31,3,24,5,"STRING"],[42,2,0,31,0,"MODEL"],[43,2,1,31,1,"CLIP"],[44,31,0,28,0,"MODEL"],[45,17,0,32,0,"LATENT"],[46,32,0,27,0,"LATENT"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.43192771084337345,"offset":[363.3333333333335,230.04741980474205]}},"version":0.4}